B.Xl=s(["Voir et modifier mon profil","W\xe8 epi modifye pwofil mwen","View and edit profile","Ver y editar perfil"],t.s)
B.a2X=s(["Changer le mot de passe","Chanje modpas","Change password","Cambiar contrase\xf1a"],t.s)
B.a5m=s(["Nouveau mot de passe","Nouvo modpas","New password","Nueva contrase\xf1a"],t.s)
B.a1N=s(["Confirmer le mot de passe","Konfime modpas","Confirm password","Confirmar contrase\xf1a"],t.s)
B.a4T=s(["Au moins 8 caract\xe8res.","Omwen 8 karakt\xe8.","At least 8 characters.","Al menos 8 caracteres."],t.s)
B.a4F=s(["Les mots de passe ne correspondent pas.","Modpas yo pa menm.","Passwords do not match.","Las contrase\xf1as no coinciden."],t.s)
B.a5_=s(["Utilisez un mot de passe unique et difficile \xe0 deviner.","S\xe8vi ak yon modpas inik ki difisil pou devine.","Use a unique password that is hard to guess.","Usa una contrase\xf1a \xfanica y dif\xedcil de adivinar."],t.s)
B.a50=s(["Supprimer mon compte","Efase kont mwen","Delete my account","Eliminar mi cuenta"],t.s)
B.a_f=s(["Cette action est irr\xe9versible. Le profil et les acc\xe8s seront supprim\xe9s. Les commandes finalis\xe9es sont conserv\xe9es sans adresse de livraison pour la comptabilit\xe9. Les commandes en cours doivent \xeatre r\xe9solues avant la suppression.","Aksyon sa pa ka anile. Pwofil ak aks\xe8 yo ap efase. K\xf2mand ki fini yo rete san adr\xe8s livrezon pou kontablite. F\xf2k k\xf2mand an kou yo regle anvan.","This action is irreversible. Your profile and access will be deleted. Completed orders are retained without delivery addresses for accounting. Active orders must be resolved first.","Esta acci\xf3n es irreversible. Se eliminar\xe1n tu perfil y acceso. Los pedidos finalizados se conservan sin direcci\xf3n para contabilidad. Primero deben resolverse los pedidos activos."],t.s)
B.a1o=s(["Une connexion r\xe9cente est requise. Pour Google, d\xe9connectez-vous puis reconnectez-vous avant de revenir ici.","Ou dwe konekte resamman. Pou Google, dekonekte epi rekonekte anvan ou retounen isit.","A recent sign-in is required. For Google, sign out and sign in again before returning here.","Se requiere un inicio de sesi\xf3n reciente. Con Google, cierra la sesi\xf3n y vuelve a entrar antes de regresar."],t.s)
B.a76=s(["Saisissez DELETE pour confirmer","Ekri DELETE pou konfime","Type DELETE to confirm","Escribe DELETE para confirmar"],t.s)
B.a6M=s(["T\xe9l\xe9phone","Telef\xf2n","Phone","Tel\xe9fono"],t.s)
B.a4z=s(["Utilisez le format 509XXXXXXXX.","Itilize f\xf2ma 509XXXXXXXX.","Use the format 509XXXXXXXX.","Usa el formato 509XXXXXXXX."],t.s)
B.Z_=s(["Champ obligatoire","Chan obligatwa","Required field","Campo obligatorio"],t.s)
B.a26=s(["Adresse e-mail v\xe9rifi\xe9e","Imel verifye","Email verified","Correo verificado"],t.s)
B.a_e=s(["Adresse e-mail non v\xe9rifi\xe9e","Imel poko verifye","Email not verified","Correo no verificado"],t.s)
B.Zp=s(["Modification impossible. V\xe9rifiez les informations ou reconnectez-vous.","Chanjman pa posib. Verifye enf\xf2masyon yo oswa rekonekte.","Unable to update. Check your details or sign in again.","No se pudo actualizar. Revisa tus datos o vuelve a iniciar sesi\xf3n."],t.s)
B.a0P=s(["\xc0 propos de l\u2019application","Kons\xe8nan app la","About the app","Acerca de la aplicaci\xf3n"],t.s)
B.a74=s(["Produit de d\xe9monstration","Pwodwi demonstrasyon","Demo product","Producto de demostraci\xf3n"],t.s)
B.a03=s(["Ce document n\u2019a pas encore \xe9t\xe9 publi\xe9 par le marchand.","Machann nan poko pibliye dokiman sa.","The merchant has not published this document yet.","El comerciante a\xfan no ha publicado este documento."],t.s)
B.a_c=s(["Enregistr\xe9","Anrejistre","Saved","Guardado"],t.s)
B.YQ=s(["Aucun moyen de paiement actif. R\xe9essayez plus tard.","Pa gen mwayen peman aktif. Eseye pita.","No active payment methods. Please try later.","No hay m\xe9todos de pago activos. Int\xe9ntalo m\xe1s tarde."],t.s)
B.a1M=s(["Le serveur v\xe9rifiera les prix et le stock avant de r\xe9server la commande. Le paiement sera confirm\xe9 s\xe9par\xe9ment.","S\xe8v\xe8 a ap verifye pri ak stock anvan li rez\xe8ve k\xf2mand la. Peman ap konfime apa.","The server checks prices and stock before reserving your order. Payment is confirmed separately.","El servidor verifica precios y stock antes de reservar el pedido. El pago se confirma por separado."],t.s)
B.a31=s(["Continuer vers le paiement","Kontinye pou peye","Continue to payment","Continuar al pago"],t.s)
B.a6Q=s(["Paiement s\xe9curis\xe9","Peman sekirize","Secure payment","Pago seguro"],t.s)
