B.a2O=s(["Un retrait transf\xe8re des fonds r\xe9els et peut entra\xeener des frais. V\xe9rifiez le num\xe9ro et le montant. En cas de doute, v\xe9rifiez la r\xe9f\xe9rence existante sans recommencer le transfert.","Yon retr\xe8 transfere lajan rey\xe8l epi li ka gen fr\xe8. Verifye nimewo ak montan. Si gen dout, verifye referans ki deja egziste a san rek\xf2manse transf\xe8 a.","A withdrawal transfers real funds and may incur fees. Check the number and amount. If uncertain, verify the existing reference instead of starting another transfer.","Un retiro transfiere fondos reales y puede tener comisiones. Verifica el n\xfamero y el importe. Si hay dudas, consulta la referencia existente sin repetir la transferencia."],t.s)
B.a01=s(["Publiez vos conditions, votre politique de confidentialit\xe9 et vos coordonn\xe9es valid\xe9es dans chaque langue. Aucun texte fictif n\u2019est publi\xe9 automatiquement.","Pibliye kondisyon, politik vi prive ak kontak ou valide nan chak lang. Pa gen t\xe8ks envante ki pibliye otomatikman.","Publish your approved terms, privacy policy and contact details in each language. No fictitious text is published automatically.","Publica tus t\xe9rminos, pol\xedtica de privacidad y datos de contacto aprobados en cada idioma. No se publica texto ficticio autom\xe1ticamente."],t.s)
B.a5T=s(["Charger le document","Chaje dokiman","Load document","Cargar documento"],t.s)
B.a2R=s(["Titre","Tit","Title","T\xedtulo"],t.s)
B.ZW=s(["Contenu","Kontni","Content","Contenido"],t.s)
B.Z0=s(["Retrait ex\xe9cut\xe9.","Retr\xe8 a ekzekite.","Withdrawal completed.","Retiro ejecutado."],t.s)
B.a5C=s(["Op\xe9ration non confirm\xe9e. V\xe9rifiez le statut avant toute nouvelle tentative.","Operasyon pa konfime. Verifye estati a anvan ou eseye ank\xf2.","Operation not confirmed. Check its status before trying again.","Operaci\xf3n no confirmada. Verifica su estado antes de reintentar."],t.s)
B.a6z=s(["Solde marchand insuffisant.","Balans machann pa sifi.","Insufficient merchant balance.","Saldo del comerciante insuficiente."],t.s)
B.X6=s(["Jeton d\xe9j\xe0 utilis\xe9. V\xe9rifiez le retrait existant.","Jeton deja itilize. Verifye retr\xe8 ki egziste a.","Token already used. Verify the existing withdrawal.","Token ya utilizado. Verifica el retiro existente."],t.s)
B.a3l=s(["Transfert refus\xe9 par le prestataire. V\xe9rifiez la r\xe9f\xe9rence et le num\xe9ro.","Founis\xe8 a refize transf\xe8 a. Verifye referans ak nimewo a.","Provider rejected the transfer. Check the reference and phone number.","El proveedor rechaz\xf3 la transferencia. Verifica la referencia y el n\xfamero."],t.s)
B.Y9=s(["R\xe9f\xe9rence d\xe9j\xe0 utilis\xe9e. Consultez son statut, ne r\xe9p\xe9tez pas le transfert.","Referans deja itilize. Gade estati li, pa repete transf\xe8 a.","Reference already used. Check its status; do not repeat the transfer.","Referencia ya utilizada. Consulta su estado; no repitas la transferencia."],t.s)
B.a0_=s(["Attendez au moins 120 secondes entre les retraits.","Tann omwen 120 segonn ant retr\xe8 yo.","Wait at least 120 seconds between withdrawals.","Espera al menos 120 segundos entre retiros."],t.s)
B.XE=s(["Les retraits doivent \xeatre activ\xe9s par le responsable du serveur.","Responsab s\xe8v\xe8 a dwe aktive retr\xe8 yo.","Withdrawals must be enabled by the server administrator.","El administrador del servidor debe habilitar los retiros."],t.s)
B.a1J=s(["Le service de paiement n\u2019est pas encore configur\xe9.","S\xe8vis peman an poko konfigire.","The payment service is not configured yet.","El servicio de pago a\xfan no est\xe1 configurado."],t.s)
B.a4o=s(["R\xe9solvez les commandes en cours avant de supprimer le compte.","Regle k\xf2mand an kou yo anvan ou efase kont la.","Resolve active orders before deleting your account.","Resuelve los pedidos activos antes de eliminar la cuenta."],t.s)
B.a_F=s(["Reconnectez-vous avant de supprimer votre compte.","Rekonekte anvan ou efase kont ou.","Sign in again before deleting your account.","Vuelve a iniciar sesi\xf3n antes de eliminar tu cuenta."],t.s)
B.a4Z=s(["Transf\xe9rez les responsabilit\xe9s administrateur avant la suppression.","Transfere responsablite admin yo anvan sipresyon.","Transfer administrator responsibilities before deletion.","Transfiere las responsabilidades de administrador antes de eliminar la cuenta."],t.s)
B.a2T=s(["Logo invalide : PNG, JPEG ou WebP, maximum 2 Mo.","Logo pa valab: PNG, JPEG oswa WebP, maksim\xf2m 2 Mo.","Invalid logo: PNG, JPEG or WebP, maximum 2 MB.","Logo no v\xe1lido: PNG, JPEG o WebP, m\xe1ximo 2 MB."],t.s)
